{"title":"202403 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch二级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"Scratch","level":2,"yearmonth":"202403","year":"2024","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"默认小猫角色，运行程序后，舞台上出现的图形是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17141181622871.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141181763191.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141181836362.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141181896993.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141181953043.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"由程序可知，先向右移动100，再向上100。故答案为A。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项可以使虫子移到蝴蝶旁边？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17141182979767.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141183175614.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141183221286.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141183288437.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141183342891.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"由图可知，蝴蝶在舞台的右上角，那么x、y坐标都为正数。故答案为A。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如下图所示，角色可以沿着白线自动移动，右图程序中缺少自动转向部分，下列哪个选项可以实现自动转向？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17141184285163.jpg"},{"img":"assets/images/17141184355347.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141184519381.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141184621888.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141184672141.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141184731257.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"由题意可知，要想实现自动转向，需要角色红色碰到蓝色向右转，绿色碰到蓝色向左转。故答案为：A。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"根据前三组数字的规律，最后一组数字是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17141185609155.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141185779774.jpg"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141185838882.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141185892647.jpg"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17141185956734.jpg"}]}],"answer"